  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Buy new clothes for 200 Syrian orphans north Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the deterioration of the economic conditions in Lebanon and Syria, the priority of families fleeing the war in Syria has become to secure water and food, while neglecting the children&apos;s need for joy in new clothes. Therefore, this project will target the most affected and poorest group of families and provide new clothes for their children. This project will provide new clothes for 200 Syrian orphans in the camps of Lebanon and northern Syria.</narrative>
  </description>
